# lines 4.51/4.49/4.47/4.40 vs 4.51/4.48/4.46/4.32, chunk20 4.492 vs 4.483 -> use it for warnings; engine settings above unchanged. Shipped ep 20:
# chunk20 4.496 / line mean 4.464, 181 wpm speaking, f0 16.4 st. Lesson: padding a line to sound 'more natural' can lower it (4.41 -> 4.37); keep lines tight.
